<title>UK: Ontario sets $50 mln five-year capped callable FRN.</title>
<headline>Ontario sets $50 mln five-year capped callable FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager DKB International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ONTARIO</p>
<p> AMT    $50 MLN	 BASE	 6M-LIBOR  MATURITY   *10.JAN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +30 BP    PAY DATE    10.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING    NONE	ISS PRICE  100.25    FULL FEES   25 BP</p>
<p> DENOMS (M) ONE	 GOV LAW    ONTARIO   HOME CTRY   CANADA</p>
<p> NOTES   *CALLABLE ON 10.JAN.00 AND EVERY SIX MONTHS THEREAFTER</p>
<p>	    ISSUED FROM AN MTN PROGRAMME.</p>
<p>	    UNSECURED.</p>
<p>	    CAPPED AT 6.80 PCT.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
